    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the way you put that is... it's heavy. but it feels so true. like, if i actually stopped being part of their lives, they could finally breathe again. eventually it feels like the only thing i can do to be good to them is to just not be there anymore. like it would be a selfless thing to do. do you really think that's a valid way to look at it?",
